Sales Case Study – Retail Product Analysis
This project analyzes a simulated dataset, Sales Case Study.csv, containing daily sales information for a single retail product. The purpose of the project is to explore sales performance, profitability, pricing behaviour, and promotional periods using SQL, Python, or BI tools.

Dataset Description
Each row in the dataset represents aggregated daily performance for a single product.
The dataset includes the following fields:
Column	Description
Date	The day on which the sales occurred
Sales	Total Rand value of sales for that day
Cost of Sales	Total Rand value of the cost associated with those sales
Quantity Sold	Total number of units sold on that day
The dataset represents only one product, making it ideal for unit-pricing, margin analysis, and time-based insights.

