Promotional Period Identification
Using pricing fluctuations, quantity spikes, or margin drops, three promotional/special periods were selected.
These periods typically show:
Lower price per unit
Higher quantities sold
Reduced margin percentage
(You can list the actual date ranges you identified here.)

Tools Used
Python (Pandas, Matplotlib/Seaborn) for analysis & visualization
SQL (Snowflake / BigQuery) for data querying
Excel / Sheets for quick checks and validations
Power BI / Tableau for dashboards (optional)

Insights & Summary
This analysis helps reveal:
Daily sales performance trends
Price sensitivity and customer behaviour
Profitability at both unit and daily levels
How promotions influence quantity sold and margins
These insights can support better pricing decisions, promotion planning, and financial forecasting.
